OL,3,GNEWSAHow can you see Friday's 'Magical'
OL,4,ABlood Moon?
OL,5,
OL,6,FStargazers across the West have a
OL,7,Fchance to see a rare Blood Moon this
OL,8,Fweek, with the Sun, Earth and Moon set
OL,9,Fto line up in the night sky just weeks
OL,10,Fafter the UK experienced its most
OL,11,Fdramatic partial solar eclipse in
OL,12,Fnearly 30 years.
OL,14,FA partial lunar eclipse will take place
OL,15,Fin the early hours of Friday, when the
OL,16,FMoon enters Earth's darkest shadow. The
OL,17,Flack of light hitting the Moon will
OL,18,Fgive it an eerie reddish glow.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
