OL,3,GNEWSAHow can you see Friday's 'Magical'
OL,4,ABlood Moon?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAdding to the spectacle, its position
OL,7,Fin the sky will be low on the horizon,
OL,8,Fcausing a phenomenon known as the 'Moon
OL,9,FIllusion', when it appears much larger
OL,10,Fthan normal.
OL,12,FJonathan Hall, from the Bath
OL,13,FAstronomers Society, said: "I think
OL,14,Fthey [Blood Moon's] have a certain sort
OL,15,Fof magical feeling about them."
